Collection of tools to manage movies.

mdiffer - displays duplicate movie names between two directories. Results are
written to the repository-local output directory.

mremover - recursively removes files with a given extension from a directory,
including matching files directly inside the source directory. Use the preview
prompt before deleting.

mrenamer - renames scene-style movie folders and files to the `Title (Year)`
format.

msymlinker - symlinks a folder from a new location to the original location.
On Windows, symlink creation may require Developer Mode or an elevated shell.
